{% comment %}

SOOTHING SAUNAS — UNIVERSAL SEPARATOR LINE (Responsive):
- Each separator instance has a unique class name like .sep-1234567890-abcd.
- That guarantees its responsive CSS block only affects that specific separator, avoids CSS caching quirks.
- The inline <style> will always be read because it’s scoped and inserted directly beside its element.

USE: {% render 'my-separatorline' %}

{% endcomment %}

{% assign sep_color = color | default: '#a08119' %}
{% assign sep_thickness = thickness | default: 2 %}
{% assign sep_width = width | default: '99%' %}
{% assign sep_opacity = opacity | default: 0.3 %}
{% assign sep_margin = margin | default: '20px auto' %}
{% assign sep_mobile_width = mobile_width | default: '80%' %}

{% assign unique_id = 'sep-' | append: section.id | append: '-' | append: block.id | default: 'global' %}

<div class="my-separatorline {{ unique_id }}"
  style="
    display: block;
    border-bottom: solid {{ sep_thickness }}px {{ sep_color }};
    width: {{ sep_width }};
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: {{ sep_margin }};
    opacity: {{ sep_opacity }};
    box-sizing: border-box;
  ">
</div>

<style>
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .{{ unique_id }} {
    width: {{ sep_mobile_width }} !important;
  }
}
</style>